<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean oil major sales activity in the week ended Sept 12 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p> Net Sales:   1995/96		    1996/97</p>
<p> Unknown	  2,700			  Nil</p>
